            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lūshikū lwa kwandya ng'weji gwa kadatū, ng'waka gwikūmi na gūmò, mhayo go ng'wa Seeba gūkanizīīla gūlīhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa munhū, ū Falao ū ntemi wa Misili na a mabità gakwe ng'wīlage:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Īkī ū goi gūkalīha gūja kwigūlya no, ī neno yaago yūbiza higūlya y'ipoolu lyose, hūna gwikumīlīja kūlwa būlīhu waago, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakagūtūūla mu makono ga nsugi wa mahanga agwītīle kūlenganīla nū būbi waago; nūgūponya kū mhelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahanga mibonya ga bibonya giza gūūgūbbutagūla gūūgūleka henaho; a matambī gago gūūgwa būlī kwene ū mu ngūlū, nū mu njonga. A matambī ayo gabbutagūlile gūsambaala pye a hose ū mu myongo ya sī. Pye a mahanga ga mu sī gīnga ū mu mbeho ya ntī gwenūyo gūng'ula gajile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī noni ja kūlala jūyifuulīla a ha ntī ūyo gwalī gwabbutagūlwa gwenūyo; ī shiinū ja mu mapoolu jūyikala jikwibisanyaga ū mu matambī gago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ītilongīle mitī yīngī hangī ya kūkūla yūbiza na būlīhu wa kwikumīlīja īkī īzwīlile hihī na minzī, ītūlīha īkīlanīje a ha mitī ī yīngī pyī īyo īlī ng'wipoolu. Ndūhū mitī yīngī ya ha minzī mingī gīko īyo īkūlīha īshikile ū būlīhu wenūbo; pyī ī yose īhelelilwe kūcha, kūja mu gatī ya sī kū bafu, ūko bakajaga banhū ba kūcha, īkisangīje na a babo balī ng'wichongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Ū mu lūshikū lwene gūkichiwa mu shigila",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu shigila:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shihebulania, kūlimu (nū mu ng'hī. 16,17).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ū ntī gwenūyo, ī nzwīlo ī shimu nakajikundīkīja ng'hūngū kūlwa nguno yaago; ī myongo īyo īkenhaga mo minzī nīhangīja, a minzī gayo a mingī gūūlemejiwa ū kūsela. Kūlwa nguno yaago ū ntī gwenūyo, ī Lebanoni nakīfīkīja ilundu, pyī ī mitī ya mu matogolo yūnyaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho naagūponeja mu shigila kūjisangīja nabo abo balī ng'wichongo nakagadetemya a mahanga, kūlwa shiligityo sha kūgwa kwago. Hūna pyī ī mitī ya mu Edeni, ī misoga na misolwa ya kūfuma Lebanoni, pyī īyo yapandīkaga minzī mingī, īkalūngūja ūko īlī ū kū bafu ū mu gatī ya sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a babo bikalaga ū mu mbeho yaago, a ba kūfuma mu mahanga ayo gaal'isangī līmò nago, nabo bakaja hamò nago ū mu shigila, kūjiisangīja na a babo baabūlagwa bo līlūshū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
